============
 dbt7-report
============

---------------
Database Test 7
---------------

:Date: @MANDATE@
:Manual section: 1
:Manual group: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@ Documentation
:Version: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@

SYNOPSIS
========

**dbt7-report** [option...] directory

DESCRIPTION
===========

**dbt7-report** is the Database Test 7 (DBT-7) report generator

OPTIONS
=======

--skip-database-plotting  Don't plot database statistics.
--skip-process-plotting  Don't plot per process statistics.
-V, --version  Output version information, then exit.
--help  This usage message.  Or **-?**.

*directory* is the path to existing DBT-7 test results.  The generated
report files are written into the same *directory*.

ENVIRONMENT
===========

**GENERATE_PDF**

    Set to 1 to also generate PDF versions of the reports with **pandoc**.

SEE ALSO
========

**dbt7**\ (1), **dbt7-run**\ (1)
